.................... // IOCMD = 0 ;// 1 = IOC module(s) disabled ; 0 = IOC module(s) enabled ; Disable Interrupt-on-Change bit, All Ports 
.................... // Note 1: When enabling NVM, a delay of up to 1 ?s may be required before accessing data. 
.................... //////////////////////////////////////////////////////// 
....................  
